s lane neighbors, and the SASE output [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]variables the run set, using one consistent, deterministic page [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]anatomy.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agent_page_artifacts.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Page shell, breadcrumbs, and golden refresh tooling[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]shell[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]shell: split the browsing renderer into focused modules, add breadcrumb [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]navigation to agent and family pages, and add the pytest flag that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrites the agents-sync markdown goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Commit artifacts on agent and family pages[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]commits[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]commits: resolve the primary repository remote during inventory and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render per-run and per-family commit tables whose SHAs link to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hosted commit page when the remote is GitHub.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Published SASE output variables[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]vars[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vars: carry sanitized `output_variables` across the v2 wire under strict[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validation, render them on agent and family pages, and restore them into[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]imported local artifacts.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lane neighbors on agent and family pages[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]neighbors[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]neighbors: build the name-derived lane kinship projection for a hood [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot and render the Neighbors section with ancestor, descendant, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hood-group rows that link to their pages.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Whole-page integration, docs, and consistency pass[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after commits, vars, neighbors[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: add the all-sections integration golden, reconcile section order[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and anchors across the three feature phases, and document the complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]page anatomy.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a9","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-a9.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-75ba345033f282e84500d8560404a9ad","started_at":"2026-07-27T16:39:21.952842","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785187778,"sha":"11ddd277631aa24521c24e4d8d484d904a704e54","subject":"feat(agents-sync): publish linked commit artifacts (sase-a9.2)"}],"dismissed_at":"2026-07-27T17:30:39.080134","files":{"chat":{"digest":"865f8d423b38c0850b34ffa3ff38ba7910e3a3015f88432ed2f148c8b99d0353","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/chat.md","size_bytes":8156},"commits":{"digest":"bd0c432cf9c4b1ae8375ca4429db600dde29a5628cd5500aa8e6521c6e747ad5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/commits.json","size_bytes":240},"meta":{"digest":"24a1fc7139776cee04c41f1baea0ffa8c57da353b0ab4f34e933189ca4c96b10","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/meta.json","size_bytes":558},"st